Limitations
Repaint surface. The current bar's trail flip, CHoCH break, and close-based scoring can change until the bar closes. HTF Fib Projection redraws at barstate.islast. Alerts and gates use barstate.isconfirmed, so the signal does not repaint — but the drawing does.

Compute weight. This script is heavy. Use "Calc Only Last N Bars" and "Show Last N Zones" on high-timeframe or long-history charts. Drawing budget is 500 labels / 500 boxes / 500 lines each, managed by an active-set / stored-set recycling system.

Synthetic instruments. Synthetic volume data is often not meaningful. The fusion layer discounts it automatically, but the 8-node score does not. On synthetic indices, consider disabling the Volume node in the confluence score.

Intraday execution. The script is designed for intraday workflows, but execution quality depends on your connection, your platform, and your discipline. The script does not place trades. It produces analysis. The execution is yours.

Different instruments behave differently. This script was developed and tested on liquid markets. Evaluate it on the instruments and timeframes you intend to use it on.

